  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p0982:b001:l004": "Баш экенин: leader reading attached provisionally to the marksman. Subject is unstated and could instead refer to the speaker’s authority; raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0982:b001:l006": "бадана bullet-resistant heroic coat/mail, local edition glossary1834:33. Its protection is a narrative claim.",
    "manas-2010:p0982:b001:l020": "Solidly built fortress retained as metaphor for Almambet, repeated999:37; not a literal transformation.",
    "manas-2010:p0982:b001:l025": "суп garment of white camel wool, local glossary1842:29. English lexical gloss used throughout, not an unexplained fabric name.",
    "manas-2010:p0982:b001:l029": "Alake retained as affectionate form of Almambet, not a different character.",
    "manas-2010:p0983:b001:l018": "күлазык durable food for distant travel, local glossary1840:26ff; travel rations, no invented recipe.",
